  "policy": [
    "One canonical Place can have multiple subject records and multiple licensed images per subject",
    "Subjects, artifacts, artworks and relics are NOT new Place pins",
    "An object may have a temporary or historical location: keep custody, photographed_location, photographed_at and current_display separate",
    "Do not treat a reliquary photograph as proof that the enclosed relic is visibly shown",
    "Distinguish photographs of 1806/19th-century reliquaries and the modern Dubuisson installation; never label an old display photo as current",
